+/* The shared .detail-row keeps its label on one line (flex:none). In the restore dialog several labels are long
+   (e.g. 「今の記録と内容が異なる同じ記録（復元しません）」), so on a narrow dialog the label pushed the COUNT out of
+   the box. Scoped here so the record detail modal is unchanged: labels wrap, counts never shrink or wrap. */
+#restore-modal .detail-row .dl{flex:1 1 0; min-width:0; overflow-wrap:anywhere}
+#restore-modal .detail-row .dv{flex:none; white-space:nowrap}
 
